@startuml Pick Up Item - Communication Diagram
!theme plain
title **UC-3: Pick Up Item – Communication Diagram**

object ":GameView" as ui #LightBlue
object ":GameController" as ctrl #LightGreen
object ":TakeAction" as ta #LightYellow
object ":RemoveFromCellEffect" as rce #Orange
object ":AddToInventoryEffect" as aie #Orange
object ":Hero" as hero #Pink
object ":Map" as map #LightGray
object ":GridCell" as cell #LightGray
object ":Inventory" as inv #Wheat
object ":GameSession" as sess #White

ui -- ctrl
ctrl -- ta
ctrl -- rce
ctrl -- aie
ctrl -- sess
ta -- sess
ta -- hero
ta -- map
ta -- cell
ta -- inv
ta -- rce
ta -- aie
rce -- sess
rce -- map
rce -- cell
aie -- sess
aie -- hero
aie -- inv
hero -- inv

ui -> ctrl : 1: moveHero(deltaRow, deltaCol)
ctrl -> ctrl : 1.1: [ref] UC-1 Move Player
ctrl -> sess : 1.2: getHero()
ctrl -> hero : 1.3: getRow(), getCol()
ctrl -> map : 1.4: getCell(row, col)
ctrl -> cell : 1.5: getObjects()
ctrl -> ta : 1.6: <<create>> TakeAction(item)
ctrl -> ta : 1.7: resolve(session)
ta -> sess : 1.7.1: getHero()
ta -> hero : 1.7.2: getRow(), getCol()
ta -> sess : 1.7.3: getMap()
ta -> map : 1.7.4: getCell(row, col)
ta -> cell : 1.7.5: getObjects()
ta -> inv : 1.7.6: isFull()
ta -> rce : 1.7.7: <<create>> RemoveFromCellEffect(row, col, item)
ta -> aie : 1.7.8: <<create>> AddToInventoryEffect(item)
ctrl -> rce : 1.8: apply(session)
rce -> cell : 1.8.1: removeObject(item)
ctrl -> aie : 1.9: apply(session)
aie -> inv : 1.9.1: addItem(item)

note bottom of ctrl
  **GRASP Controller**: GameController coordinates pickup.
  **Creator**: Controller creates TakeAction (has item reference).
  TakeAction creates both Effects (Information Expert –
  it knows what's on the cell and inventory state).
  **Low Coupling**: Effects modify model independently.
end note

@enduml
